---
/**
 * The column a content page sits in: at most 1560px wide, centred. Full-width bands (the hero, a call to
 * action) stay outside it and put their own content in a PageColumn, so their text lines up with the page.
 */
---

<div class="flex w-full max-w-[1560px] flex-col items-center">
  <slot />
</div>
